        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            ".text-wrapper": {
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 2rem"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "header11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background7.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://mwebvexa.com/13471/3878/2/?\"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/vapocept-3-bottle-guarantee.webp\" alt=\"VapoCept\"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                        <b>Make Fun Creating</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">VapoCept is a natural cognitive support supplement formulated to help people think clearer, focus longer, and retain information more easily. Built around a blend of plant-based extracts and amino compounds, it's designed for anyone whose daily life demands consistent mental performance students cramming for exams, professionals juggling deadlines, or older adults looking to stay sharp. Unlike stimulant-based products that offer a quick jolt followed by a crash, VapoCept takes a steadier approach, supporting the brain's natural chemistry rather than forcing it into overdrive. The result is meant to feel less like a jolt of caffeine and more like your mind simply working the way it should.\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>The formula brings together five key ingredients: Ginkgo Biloba Leaf, St. John's Wort Extract, Bacopa Monnieri, N-Acetyl L-Carnitine HCl, and Huperzine-A. Each was selected for a distinct role some support blood flow to the brain, others target memory pathways, and one addresses the emotional side of mental clarity by supporting a balanced mood. Rather than stacking ingredients for marketing appeal, VapoCept's formula is built so each component reinforces the others, creating a more complete approach to cognitive wellness than a single-ingredient product could offer on its own.\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>VapoCept is made for daily use, taken as part of a simple morning routine. It isn't positioned as an instant fix like most nootropic formulas, it's designed to build results over consistent use, with many people reporting they notice a difference in mental clarity and focus over the course of several weeks. This makes it less of a one-time boost and more of a long-term investment in brain health, similar to how consistent exercise or a good diet pays off gradually rather than overnight.\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>Beyond day-to-day focus, VapoCept is also positioned around long-term brain health. Ingredients like Ginkgo Biloba carry antioxidant properties tied to protecting brain cells from oxidative stress one of the contributing factors in age-related cognitive decline. For users concerned less about short-term productivity and more about preserving memory and mental sharpness as they get older, this protective angle is a core part of what the formula is built to address, alongside its more immediate focus and clarity benefits.\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>Additionally, reduced stress levels can contribute to better sleep quality, as anxiety often disrupts the ability to fall and stay asleep. Better rest supports cognitive function, creating a positive feedback loop that fosters overall brain health. By promoting relaxation and helping to reduce anxiety, VapoCept may help users maintain mental clarity and focus, making it a valuable ally for anyone looking to manage the effects of stress on their daily lives.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Get Started</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
