        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "list-style": "none",
                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <div><b><br></b></div><ul>\n                        <li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Everyday Mental Clarity: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">VapoCept is positioned for adults who want nutritional support as part of a daily routine focused on mental clarity and concentration. Its formula combines amino acids and vitamin B3 rather than relying on a conventional stimulant approach. Mental clarity, however, is influenced by many everyday factors, including sleep, hydration, nutrition, stress, and physical activity. For that reason, VapoCept is best incorporated into a complete wellness routine rather than treated as a standalone solution. Users should also remember that individual experiences can differ. A supplement may complement healthy habits, but it should not be described as a guaranteed way to improve memory, concentration, or cognitive performance.</span></li><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Helps Support Normal Energy Metabolism:</b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;Niacin, or vitamin B3, is included in the currently published VapoCept formula and plays a role in normal energy-yielding metabolism. This makes nutritional energy support one reasonable aspect of the formula. It is important, however, to distinguish supporting normal metabolism from creating a stimulant-like energy boost. VapoCept's published ingredient panel does not list caffeine as an active ingredient. People looking for sustainable daily energy should still pay attention to sleep, balanced meals, hydration, and physical activity. VapoCept can be used as part of that routine, but it should not replace the lifestyle factors that naturally influence how energetic and alert a person feels.</span></li></ul><ul><li><b style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">Supports Nutrients Involved In Normal Circulation: </b><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">L-Arginine and L-Citrulline are included because they participate in pathways associated with nitric oxide production. Normal nitric-oxide signaling is involved in blood-vessel relaxation and circulation. The current formula contains both arginine and citrulline forms, providing multiple ingredients connected with this pathway. This biological role helps explain the formula's circulation-oriented design, but it should not be interpreted as evidence that VapoCept treats a circulation disorder or guarantees improved blood flow to the brain. People with cardiovascular conditions or those taking medications that affect blood pressure should consult a healthcare professional before beginning a new supplement.</span></li><li><b>Convenient Once-Daily Format: </b>A practical advantage of VapoCept is its straightforward serving format. Current product information states that the product comes with 30 capsules and recommends one capsule daily with an 8-ounce glass of water. A simple routine can be easier to maintain than a supplement program requiring several servings throughout the day. Consistency is particularly useful when someone is building a broader wellness routine around sleep, nutrition, movement, and mental activities. Convenience does not itself determine effectiveness, though. Users should still follow the label instructions, avoid exceeding the recommended serving, and check with a healthcare professional when medication or an existing health condition could affect supplement use.</li><li><b>Provides A Combination Of Complementary Nutrients: </b>Rather than depending on one ingredient, VapoCept combines multiple nutritional compounds with different roles. The current published formula lists L-Arginine, L-Arginine AKG, L-Citrulline HCl, L-Citrulline Malate, Niacin, Calcium, and Beta-Alanine. This combination gives the product a broader nutritional profile than a single-ingredient supplement. Each ingredient should nevertheless be evaluated individually, including its dose and established biological role. A multi-ingredient formula is not automatically better than a single ingredient, and more ingredients do not guarantee better results. The most sensible approach is to use the product according to its label and maintain realistic expectations about what nutritional supplementation can accomplish.</li></ul><ul>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
